{"cut_proposal":{"candidate_errors":[],"prefix":"To find the sum of the proper divisors of 198, we need to first determine all the proper divisors of 198 and then sum them up. Proper divisors of a number are all the divisors of that number excluding the number itself.\n\nFirst, we find the prime factorization of 198:\n\\[ 198 = 2 \\times 99 = 2 \\times 3 \\times 33 = 2 \\times 3 \\times 3 \\times 11 = 2 \\times 3^2 \\times 11. \\]\n\nNext, we list all the divisors of 198. Using the prime factorization, the divisors are:\n\\[ 1, 2, 3, 6, 9, 11, 18, 22, 33, 66, 99, 198. \\]\n\n","prefix_end":513,"status":"review_required"},"eligible":false,"generation":{"generation":{"max_new_tokens":2048,"temperature":0.7,"top_k":0,"top_p":1.0},"ids":[1249,1477,279,2629,315,279,6169,3429,41214,315,220,16,24,23,11,582,1184,311,1156,8253,678,279,6169,3429,41214,315,220,16,24,23,323,1221,2629,1105,705,13,64558,3429,41214,315,264,1372,525,678,279,3429,41214,315,429,1372,43778,279,1372,5086,382,5338,11,582,1477,279,10250,8168,2022,315,220,16,24,23,510,78045,220,16,24,23,284,220,17,1124,15136,220,24,24,284,220,17,1124,15136,220,18,1124,15136,220,18,18,284,220,17,1124,15136,220,18,1124,15136,220,18,1124,15136,220,16,16,284,220,17,1124,15136,220,18,61,17,1124,15136,220,16,16,13,1124,2533,5847,11,582,1140,678,279,3429,41214,315,220,16,24,23,13,12091,279,10250,8168,2022,11,279,3429,41214,525,510,78045,220,16,11,220,17,11,220,18,11,220,21,11,220,24,11,220,16,16,11,220,16,23,11,220,17,17,11,220,18,18,11,220,21,21,11,220,24,24,11,220,16,24,23,13,1124,2533,785,6169,3429,41214,525,678,279,3429,41214,3650,220,16,24,23,5086,510,78045,220,16,11,220,17,11,220,18,11,220,21,11,220,24,11,220,16,16,11,220,16,23,11,220,17,17,11,220,18,18,11,220,21,21,11,220,24,24,13,1124,2533,7039,11,582,2629,1493,6169,3429,41214,510,78045,220,16,488,220,17,488,220,18,488,220,21,488,220,24,488,220,16,16,488,220,16,23,488,220,17,17,488,220,18,18,488,220,21,21,488,220,24,24,13,1124,2533,1654,646,912,1493,3019,553,3019,510,780